o talk to  you in a place that is one of my  favorite places in the world  oh i love that well thanks so much for  sharing that and thank you so much for  your time  i love this show i grew up um like  loving smarties and macintosh toffee  okay you're one of us yeah you know how  to smack it on the concrete and break it  in little pieces i know those tricks  you work for it yeah thanks so much
 

